OL,3,AWomen given shorts at Oktoberfest to
OL,4,Aprevent upskirting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operator of a popular amusement
OL,7,Fride at the Munich Oktoberfest has been
OL,8,Fhanding out free cycling shorts to
OL,9,Fwomen, after thousands of voyeuristic
OL,10,Fvideos emerged on social media.
OL,12,FSome videos showing women on the
OL,13,FTeufelsrad, or Devil's Wheel, have been
OL,14,Fviewed millions of times. One is said
OL,15,Fto have made thousands of euros for a
OL,16,Fwoman who posted it online.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
