OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWomen given shorts at Oktoberfest to
OL,4,Aprevent upskirting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Teufelsrad is one of the oldest
OL,7,Fattractions at the Oktoberfest, the
OL,8,Fannual beer festival which comes to an
OL,9,Fend this weekend after 16 days. Its
OL,10,Fcircular platform rotates faster and
OL,11,Ffaster until its riders fall off, and
OL,12,Fthe motion and speed often make skirts
OL,13,Ffly up.
OL,15,FFilming under skirts is illegal in
OL,16,FGermany, and carries a two-year
OL,17,Fsentence in jail.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
